ICipher <|.. CipherBase : implements
CipherBase <|-- AesCipher
CipherBase <|-- RsaCipher
CipherBase <|-- EccCipher
CipherBase ..> CryptoException : raises
CipherFactory ..> ICipher : creates
CipherFactory ..> CipherType : reads

EllipticCurve ..> ECPoint : operates on
EccCipher ..> EllipticCurve : uses
EccCipher ..> AesCipher : uses
RsaCipher ..> AesCipher : uses
EllipticCurve ..> BigIntCalculator : uses

AsymmetricKey <|-- PublicKey
AsymmetricKey <|-- PrivateKey
KeyPair *-- PublicKey
KeyPair *-- PrivateKey

ISigner <|.. RsaSigner
ISigner <|.. EcdsaSigner
RsaSigner ..> HashService : accepts SHA-256 digest
EcdsaSigner ..> HashService : accepts SHA-256 digest
RsaSigner ..> DigitalSignature : creates/verifies
EcdsaSigner ..> DigitalSignature : creates/verifies

IKeyRepository <|.. FileKeyRepository
KeyService --> IKeyRepository : delegates
KeyService ..> KeyPair : manages
KeyService ..> AppConfig : reads settings

SecureMessenger o-- ICipher : current strategy
SecureMessenger --> KeyService : key lifecycle
SecureMessenger --> ISigner : signing strategy
SecureMessenger ..> DigitalSignature : uses
AuditLogger ..> SecureMessenger : subscribes to event

ConsoleMenu --> SecureMessenger : calls
ConsoleMenu --> KeyService : calls
ConsoleMenu --> AuditLogger : reads
ConsoleMenu --> User : checks role

note for HashService "SHA256 được gọi đúng một lần.\nSigner nhận digest ở chế độ Prehashed."
note for ECPoint "Value Object; EllipticCurve thực hiện phép toán điểm."
note for SecureMessenger "Phát MessageProcessed; không phụ thuộc ngược vào AuditLogger."
